description = "Needs an area Warden {near} a Firefly Warden. Its pulse or splash on 2 or more nightmares {jumps} half to the nearest one it missed."
tip = "Half of the most it landed on one nightmare. Once per pulse or splash. Sparkler and Starburst count when near another Firefly Warden. Works for: Wardens that hit an area. A bet: it does little until one stands near a Firefly Warden."
